(7527604, 1203681, 124815, '<td valign="top">This has so many qualities and it''s a great find - (plus the fact that I have a huge admiration for Pinkhassov and given the time he''d have been my choice also) but there are things that do not appeal to me; the composition is the lacking the power of the content or the pushing of the pp on the woman''s arm for instance. You might have tried to turn it in B&amp;W and increase the contrast although Pinkhassov''s magic is in the contrasting colors and light...., what do I know (I struggled with my entry also)</td>', 'This has so many qualities and it''s a great find - (plus the fact that I have a huge admiration for Pinkhassov and given the time he''d have been my choice also) but there are things that do not appeal to me; the composition is the lacking the power of the content or the pushing of the pp on the woman''s arm for instance. You might have tried to turn it in B&W and increase the contrast although Pinkhassov''s magic is in the contrasting colors and light...., what do I know (I struggled with my entry also)', '2017-08-07 23:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7527605, 1203292, 124815, '<td valign="top">What a find! One has to spend time to look at the cast of characters. Too bad about the increased sharpening and its haloes <br/>bump</td>', 'What a find! One has to spend time to look at the cast of characters. Too bad about the increased sharpening and its haloes bump', '2017-08-07 23:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7527613, 1203737, 114285, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it''s just the processing I like on this image, or the image itself.  I think it''s the former.   In fact I know for sure it is the former. I''ve looked up Trent Parke''s work and it''s astonishing it''s brilliant it absorbs the mind, he''s probably one of the better photographers on Magnum to be sure and to emulate him is a rather difficult task, I don''t think you have achieved that brilliance, in my humble opinion. Still nevertheless a good try.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it''s just the processing I like on this image, or the image itself.  I think it''s the former.   In fact I know for sure it is the former. I''ve looked up Trent Parke''s work and it''s astonishing it''s brilliant it absorbs the mind, he''s probably one of the better photographers on Magnum to be sure and to emulate him is a rather difficult task, I don''t think you have achieved that brilliance, in my humble opinion. Still nevertheless a good try.', '2017-08-07 23:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7527615, 1203708, 114285, '<td valign="top">I have looked up Harrys images and I''m not sure this is really honoring his work, but it did get my attention for a little while at least.</td>', 'I have looked up Harrys images and I''m not sure this is really honoring his work, but it did get my attention for a little while at least.', '2017-08-07 23:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
