(7528428, 1203703, 16148, '<td valign="top">Off the leash!  A wonderful tribute to Trent Parke.  I''ve tried to capture this effect with limited success.  Your crop and exposure work well together.  Good luck.</td>', 'Off the leash!  A wonderful tribute to Trent Parke.  I''ve tried to capture this effect with limited success.  Your crop and exposure work well together.  Good luck.', '2017-08-11 18:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7528477, 1203677, 114285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bed wrangled hair this child has, and a poignant pose at that..and what an extraordinary compilation of photos the ''world is young series'' exhibits.  This photo is a near good enough  representation of Wayne Miller''s work. I would''ve gone black-and-white though. In my top two.</td>', 'Beautiful bed wrangled hair this child has, and a poignant pose at that..and what an extraordinary compilation of photos the ''world is young series'' exhibits.  This photo is a near good enough  representation of Wayne Miller''s work. I would''ve gone black-and-white though. In my top two.', '2017-08-12 09:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
