(7528783, 1203292, 19825, '<td valign="top">Your outtake is good, but I find the eclectic group in your entry more compelling. Congrats on the ribbon. Something that strikes me about both images -- I only see one or two phones. It seems like these days, I could not have captured a crowd this size in Chicago that didn''t have several phones out. It makes me wonder if the girl holding the phone and drink is the sole American tourist in the group. ;)</td>', 'Your outtake is good, but I find the eclectic group in your entry more compelling. Congrats on the ribbon. Something that strikes me about both images -- I only see one or two phones. It seems like these days, I could not have captured a crowd this size in Chicago that didn''t have several phones out. It makes me wonder if the girl holding the phone and drink is the sole American tourist in the group. ;)', '2017-08-14 17:58:32.000000', NULL, 0),
